                <h2 style="font-size: 2.75rem !important; font-weight: 800 !important; margin: 0 0 1rem 0 !important; color: #ffffff !important; letter-spacing: -0.02em !important; line-height: 1.2 !important;">Partnership Framework & Core Accords</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 1.2rem !important; line-height: 1.7 !important; color: #cbd5e1 !important; margin: 0 !important; font-weight: 400 !important;">
