                                <p style="color: #94a3b8 !important; font-size: 0.9rem !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; margin: 0 !important;">Strategic alliances providing field units with managed heavy machinery exposure, expert safety guidance, and direct commercial job placement pipelines.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4) !important; padding: 1.25rem !important; border-radius: 8px !important; border-left: 4px solid #1e6b3c !important;">
                                <h4 style="color: #e2e8f0 !important; font-size: 1rem !important; font-weight: 600 !important; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0 !important;">Mechanics of Accord</h4>
                                <p style="color: #94a3b8 !important; font-size: 0.9rem !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; margin: 0 !important;">Non-financial asset sharing and trade-for-work framework. Crews perform labor-intensive forestry support (slash piling, hand lines) in exchange for technical equipment training. Bound by a strict 250-hour apprenticeship cap for BOLI compliance.</p>
                            </div>
