                    <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(12px) !important; border-radius: 12px !important; padding: 2rem 2.5rem !important; width: 100% !important; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1) !important;">
                        <span style="color: #a3e635 !important; font-size: 0.75rem !important; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase !important; letter-spacing: 0.08em !important; display: block !important; margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;">Research &amp; Science</span>
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 1.4rem !important; font-weight: 700 !important; margin: 0 0 1rem 0 !important;">Extension Services &amp; Educational Institutions</h3>
                        
                        <div style="display: grid !important; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)) !important; gap: 1.5rem !important; margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;">
                            <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4) !important; padding: 1.25rem !important; border-radius: 8px !important; border-left: 4px solid #4A6B35 !important;">
                                <h4 style="color: #e2e8f0 !important; font-size: 1rem !important; font-weight: 600 !important; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0 !important;">Collaboration Overview</h4>
                                <p style="color: #94a3b8 !important; font-size: 0.9rem !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; margin: 0 !important;">Non-financial scientific research alliances tracking long-term soil remediation vectors, native micro-botanical seed cultivation, and fire-damaged canopy trends.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4) !important; padding: 1.25rem !important; border-radius: 8px !important; border-left: 4px solid #4A6B35 !important;">
                                <h4 style="color: #e2e8f0 !important; font-size: 1rem !important; font-weight: 600 !important; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0 !important;">Mechanics of Accord</h4>
                                <p style="color: #94a3b8 !important; font-size: 0.9rem !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; margin: 0 !important;">Asset-light telemetry sharing. Field logistics units deploy zero-cost operational labor for winter greenhouse propagation in exchange for specialized soil advisory reports and collaborative multispectral flight data loops.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6) !important; border: 1px dashed rgba(74, 107, 53, 0.4) !important; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem !important; border-radius: 6px !important; font-size: 0.9rem !important; color: #cbd5e1 !important;">
                            <strong>Governing Protocol Instrument:</strong> Non-Financial Cooperative Research &amp; Demonstration Agreement.
